The reference shows a double-leaf door swing: two teal quarter-circle arcs meeting at a center point. In the drawing, the double door near (440, 680) has this shape, with arcs from about x=367 to x=515 and the center at x=440.

The door at the bottom (around 595–665, 915–1000) is a single-swing door, so it does not match.

