The reference symbol looks like an ornamental star-pattern tile with a central fixture. In the drawing, the star-patterned floor area at the top left (around x 200–530, y 115–350) has several of these ornamental motifs in its top row, at about x = 272, 322, 372, 418 and 463, y = 140. Two further ones sit lower, at about (458, 297) and (510, 285).

I could not confirm the exact shape of each motif at this resolution, so these positions are estimates.

